  m_Name: MCQ_006
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::MCQQuestionData
  questionText: Which hormones stimulates spermatogenesis?
  referenceImage: {fileID: 0}
  explanationText: Entire process of spermatogenesis is supported by sertoli cells
    which are influenced by the FSH hormone. Sertoli cells provide nourishment to
    the developing sperms and testosterone is secreted by leydig cells.
  options:
  - FSH, LH
  - GH, FSH
  - LH, GH
  - FSH, testosterone
  correctOptionIndex: 3
